OL,3,GNEWSAM25 lane closures after biker
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree lanes on a section of the M25
OL,7,Fhave reopened after they were shut
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash involving a lorry, a
OL,9,Fcar and motorbike that caused
OL,10,Fsignificant delays.
OL,12,FSurrey Police officers were called to
OL,13,Fthe scene shortly after 08:15 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday, with National Highways
OL,15,Fsaying the carriageway between junction
OL,16,F12 (Thorpe) and junction 13 (Staines)
OL,17,Fhad fully reopened shortly after 10:40.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
