OL,3,GNEWSAM25 lane closures after biker
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency added that the vehicles
OL,7,Finvolved in the crash were moved to the
OL,8,Fhard shoulder to await recovery, and a
OL,9,Ffuel spillage had been successfully
OL,10,Ftreated.
OL,12,FThe motorcyclist, a woman in her 20s,
OL,13,Fwas taken to hospital with serious
OL,14,Finjuries, police said.
